error[SC0411]: `*pq` is read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ a_pointer_read_through_the_address_of_a_local_nothing_wrote_is_reported.c:4:10 ]
   │
 4 │     int *r = *pq;
   │          ───┬───  
   │             ╰───── read here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.2.4 p6 and 6.7.9 p10 leave a local indeterminate until something writes it, and Annex J.2 lists using that value as undefined, whether or not its address is taken
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: assign to it before reading it
